1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:04,840
All the artifacts had been returned to
their ancient places

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,060
on the eighth wonder of the world.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,140
It was time for destiny to take its
course.

4
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:55,780
The mysterious energy of all the seven
wonders of the world

5
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,080
was now united here in the obelisk.

6
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:03,240
A mighty lance of flame shot towards the
sky

7
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:05,580
and put an end to the evil.

8
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:08,240
Our heroes had won.
